Clearly distinguish manually entered estimates from verified market valuations.

## 4.9 Financial Reports & Analytics
Reports:
- Monthly income.
- Monthly expenses.
- Spending by category.
- Income versus expenses.
- Savings progress.
- Budget performance.
- Account balances.
- Net worth history.
- Recurring payment summaries.

Visualizations:
- Donut charts.
- Bar charts.
- Line charts.
- Cash-flow timelines.
