## 6.2 Goal Hierarchy
Every goal can contain multiple projects.

Structure:

GOAL
→ PROJECTS
→ TASKS
→ CHECKLISTS
→ MILESTONES

Example:

Goal: Renovate the family home.

Projects:
- Renovate the kitchen.
- Improve the living room.
- Redecorate bedrooms.

Tasks:
- Establish budget.
- Research materials.
- Select suppliers.
- Purchase materials.
- Complete renovation.

## 6.3 Milestones
Break large goals into measurable stages.

Features:
- Milestone title.
- Target date.
- Completion status.
- Progress indicator.
- Supporting tasks.
- Achievement history.

## 6.4 Goal Progress Dashboard
Display:
- Active goals.
- Completed goals.
- Delayed goals.
- Goal progress.
- Upcoming milestones.
- Contributions by members.

## 6.5 Individual & Shared Goals
Support:
- Personal goals.
- Couple goals.
- Parenting goals.
- Child development goals.
- Household goals.
- Whole-family goals.

## 6.6 AI-Assisted Goal Planning
Future functionality:
- Turn an idea into a structured goal.
- Suggest project breakdowns.
- Generate task lists.
- Suggest milestones.
- Identify possible scheduling conflicts.
- Provide progress summaries.

AI-generated suggestions must always remain editable and subject to user approval.

**Expected Outcome:** A practical system for turning family ambitions into organized projects and measurable achievements.

